//   - market: The market it is imported into; read off the file when omitted.
//   - mode: merge (the newer file wins where it has rows; older rows stay where it has none) or replace (every day the file covers is cleared first). merge when omitted.
//   - read: How the file is read, beyond the reader's own detection.
//   - spread_points: The spread, in points, for a file of bids alone or candles with no spread column.
//   - workbench: A workbench of the laboratory the market is added to when it lands.
