// Cuts the workbench's days into windows of in_sample_days and the out_of_sample_days after them (anchored: every in-sample stretch starts at the first day; rolling: the in-sample days before), and for each window in turn runs the grid as a batch over its in-sample days, chooses the cell with the highest in-sample net, and runs it as chosen over the out-of-sample days on a bench whose days begin at the in-sample start. Every cell and every out-of-sample run is a trial in the ledger, naming the walk and the window. Answers the walk's uri; walk_get reads its windows and, once ended, its record.
// Scope: lab. Since: 1.14.0.
//   - strategy: The saved strategy's name.
